Portal 2 materials

The mod uses the following materials from Portal 2 and modified versions of them:

- models and animations;
- textures and shaders;
- sounds and particle definitions.

In the source tree, the resources listed below are located relative to
common/src/main/resources/assets/portalix/; in the JAR, relative to assets/portalix/:

- meshes/*.pgmesh — gun models and animations;
- textures/model/, textures/portals/, textures/source_particles/ — textures;
- textures/gui/*/reticle_*.png — crosshair variants;
- textures/particle/core_glow.png and textures/effects/: combinemuzzle2.png,
  energyball.png, impact_sparks_sequence6.png, particle_glow_01.png,
  particle_glow_05.png, projectile_fiber.png, spark.png, sparks.png,
  strider_bluebeam.png — effect textures, including a cropped portion of
  particle/sparks/sparks.vtf used for impact_sparks_sequence6.png;
- source_particles/ and portals/ — material and particle definitions, effect
  recordings and extracted data tables;
- sounds/*.ogg and source_sound_settings.json — sounds and their parameters;
- gun_palettes.json — particle, crosshair and portal palettes extracted from Portal 2.

This list includes converted and edited versions of these materials,
as well as extracted animation frame coordinates in the accompanying .png.mcmeta files.

shaders/include/source_portal.glsl contains a translation of portal_refract_ps20b.
shaders/core/portal.vsh adapts portal_refract_vs20, and
shaders/core/portal_particle_refract.fsh adapts refraction sampling from refract_ps20b.

